# (AI-assisted) "play as Keira" host check (CTR_KEIRA_FORCE=1 draws her; L1+R1 + pc-3ds-keira-pick!
# makes her sounds): idle from behind, the side, the front, the other side (C-stick orbits), walk,
# run, jump, double jump, punch, spin kick, a hit (her hurt sound). Logs: CTR_KEIRA_VOICE_LOG=1 (her
# voice), CTR_KEIRA_DAX_LOG=1 (Daxter's seat); shots with --ctr-dump. Silent: OPENGOAL_NO_SOUND=1.
0 wait *target* target-title-wait
196 l1 r1
200 l1 r1 call pc-3ds-keira-pick!
202 -
210 continue village1-hut
211 wait *target* target-continue
300 tod 12
300 print *pc-3ds-keira*
400 ry=0
